  <meta name="description" content="I created an interactive Road Accident Dashboard📊 using Microsoft Excel to analyze accident casualties by vehicle type, road condition, light condition, and area.
📌This Road Accident Dashboard tells the story of road safety.
It shows total casualties and breaks them into fatal, serious, and slight injuries.
From the dashboard, we can see that most accidents are slight, but fatal accidents still need attention.
Cars cause the highest number of casualties.
Single carriageway roads and dry road surfaces have more accidents.
📌Accidents happen more in daylight and mostly in urban areas.
🔎Monthly trends help us understand which months are more risky.
📌This dashboard helps government and traffic authorities take data-driven decisions to reduce accidents.
.
.
.
.

✅This project helped me strengthen my skills in data cleaning, pivot tables, charts, slicers, and data storytelling.
✅Turning raw data into meaningful insights is a key step toward better decision-making.
#Excel #DataAnalytics #Dashboard #DataVisualization #LearningJourney">
