Single carriageway roads and dry road surfaces have more accidents.
📌Accidents happen more in daylight and mostly in urban areas.
🔎Monthly trends help us understand which months are more risky.
📌This dashboard helps government and traffic authorities take data-driven decisions to reduce accidents.
