        " dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">🚦 Road Accident Analysis Dashboard | Excel Weekend Project
This weekend, I challenged myself to convert raw road accident data into a meaningful, insight-driven dashboard using Microsoft Excel.
Turned messy road accident data into a clean, interactive Excel dashboard in 6 hours as a weekend self-project.
What happened behind the scenes 👇
Built using advanced Excel formulas, Pivot Tables, and Pivot Charts
Converted raw data into clear insights on casualties by severity, vehicle type, road type, surface condition, location, and day vs night
Designed with filters and slicers to make analysis dynamic, not static
Why this matters:
This wasn’t an assignment. It was a weekend learning challenge
Focused on data storytelling, not just visuals
Learned how small design and logic choices change how insights are understood
Real talk:
Yes, I faced errors
Yes, I used AI to increase efficiency and debug faster
No, I didn’t copy-paste. Tools help, understanding matters more
