        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">Accident Data Analysis Dashboard | Power BI Project
I recently completed an Accident Data Analysis project where I analyzed large-scale road accident data to identify critical patterns, trends, and risk factors affecting road safety.
📊 Key Insights from the Dashboard:
 • Total Accidents: 308K
 • Total Deaths: 418K
 • Total Vehicle Collisions: 563K
 • Maximum accidents occurred on Single Carriageway roads
 • Most accidents happened during Daylight conditions
 • Dry road surfaces recorded the highest number of accidents
 • Cars are the most accident-prone vehicle category
💡 This project focuses on converting raw data into actionable insights using interactive visualizations to support data-driven decision-making and improve road safety awareness.
