        attributed-text-segment-list__content-truncated" dir="ltr" data-test-id="main-feed-activity-card__commentary">📊 Day 10 of My Excel Learning Journey — Dashboard Creation
Today I created an interactive Road Accident Dashboard using Excel, analyzing accident data for 2021 &amp; 2022 in the US.
This dashboard focuses on turning raw data into meaningful insights through KPIs and visual analysis.
🔹 Primary KPIs
• Total casualties after accidents
• Casualties distribution by accident severity
• Maximum casualties by vehicle type
🔹 Secondary KPIs
• Casualties with respect to vehicle categories
📈 Insights &amp; Analysis
• Monthly trend comparison (current vs previous year)
• Maximum casualties by road type
• Distribution by road surface
• Area/location analysis with day vs night comparison
This project helped me strengthen my skills in data cleaning, pivot tables, charts, slicers, and dashboard design — transforming numbers into actionable insights.
